{"records":[{"id":"01M3CJESYF2WBDSJQM0GJGKCQ6","parent":"","index":"Zx","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"The ***simplest*** and most ***beautiful*** [outliner](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Outliner) out there. An alternative to apps like [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md), [LogSeq](https://logseq.com), [Workflowy](https://workflowy.com), [Roam Research](https://roamresearch.com), [Remnote](https://www.remnote.com) and [Dynalist](https://dynalist.io). Give it a try!","title":"Welcome to TreeWrite 👋","level":"neutral"}},{"id":"01M3CJP5NRZVK0AQBE5D3F19TG","parent":"","index":"ZxV","collapsed":false,"type":"title","fields":{"text":"Documentation","level":1}},{"id":"01M3CJQZTGBY1KNX195FMMDHA5","parent":"","index":"Zxl","collapsed":true,"note":"How files (images, PDF, ...) are stored in your file system","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Assets","icon":"🗃️","background":"#fab005"}},{"id":"01M3CK4AA3MES7HVDZBMNQYHER","parent":"","index":"Zxp","collapsed":true,"note":"How to turn your bullets into a website like this one","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Publish","icon":"🚀","background":"#7950f2"}},{"id":"01M3CK4D608BX01BDWAWPSDR8G","parent":"","index":"Zxd","collapsed":true,"note":"How bullets are stored in your file system","type":"page","fields":{"text":"File format","icon":"💾","background":"#2e2e2e"}},{"id":"01M3CK4TT3EEMYQ55VSYQVCFZK","parent":"","index":"Zxn","collapsed":true,"note":"How to integrate your bullets with Git for automatic backups and synchronization","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Git integration","icon":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18133?s=280&v=4","background":"#fd7e14"}},{"id":"01M3CKKTSAKT9DVE52BA7VV5K0","parent":"","index":"Zxm","collapsed":true,"note":"How to use tags to filter your bullets","tags":["01M3HD4Q8SDKV6D551TEB1957Q","01M3HD4Z3S8XWR28Y0KX66CH5Y"],"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Tags","icon":"🏷️","background":"#15aabf"}},{"id":"01M3CKKYE39X7JV1VXT1H4WBCJ","parent":"","index":"ZxmV","collapsed":true,"note":"How to add dates to your bullets and filter them in the calendar","date":"2000-11-11T11:11","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Calendar","icon":"🗓️","background":"#fa5252"}},{"id":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","parent":"","index":"ZxZ","collapsed":false,"note":"What are bullets and what types of bullets are there (with visual examples)","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Bullets","icon":"📚","background":"#4c6ef5"}},{"id":"01M3CNZ3ZP6FB4C9V4SABK4N7M","parent":"","index":"Zxr","collapsed":true,"note":"Some tips and tricks to help you delve deeper into TreeWrite","type":"page","fields":{"text":"Tips & Tricks","icon":"🧠","background":"#868e96"}},{"id":"01M3CP9RQ287YFRG0ZYQHANVWE","parent":"","index":"ZxG","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"You can publish your bullets on a website (that's right, this website is made with TreeWrite!). The website and the editor have the same look and feel"}},{"id":"01M3CPBKSYBSCSKNFNMYTWP891","parent":"","index":"ZxC","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Everything is a bullet, and there are many bullet types (text, code, image, checkbox, ...)"}},{"id":"01M3CPBRTH1MDH1W1EY39HBPD6","parent":"","index":"ZxE","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"All bullets are stored in a single `.jsonl` ([JSON Lines](https://jsonlines.org)) file on your computer, no cloud storage (ever). You own your data in an open and documented text file format"}},{"id":"01M3CPC4WYVXJR6NF9J3ZFYYAC","parent":"","index":"ZxF","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"You can search globally, filter by tags or by calendar"}},{"id":"01M3CZWVTPN25XC8X6A4AN53M4","parent":"","index":"ZxX","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"Learn more about how TreeWrite works"}},{"id":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","parent":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"List of bullet types"},"note":"See examples of usage/appearance of each existing bullet type"},{"id":"01M3DGA9V9JJEKMYPBXA0P7VTM","parent":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"TreeWrite has a very unique and special way of storing your bullets in your file system"}},{"id":"01M3DGAB9R7DBXJHWS477F4TQA","parent":"01M3CJQZTGBY1KNX195FMMDHA5","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DGACQ4QK785S9581TVHEM9","parent":"01M3CKKTSAKT9DVE52BA7VV5K0","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DGAE7M3Y3T2F7E3XQMP0WA","parent":"01M3CKKYE39X7JV1VXT1H4WBCJ","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DGAGR5BQZ3878HKE00APYF","parent":"01M3CK4TT3EEMYQ55VSYQVCFZK","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DGAJKTY3YZM6G60X68GACF","parent":"01M3CK4AA3MES7HVDZBMNQYHER","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DGAMS8AGTMRSEM2CVT4S44","parent":"01M3CNZ3ZP6FB4C9V4SABK4N7M","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3DHEFXP4YCDXGBEQSEP8MJT","parent":"","index":"ZxO","collapsed":false,"tags":["01M3DHY344AFH70NC540WDC2T3"],"type":"text","fields":{"text":"**Convinced?** [Install TreeWrite](https://google.com) and start organizing your bullets"}},{"id":"01M3DZYGXAGMKQ6ZE8G0HP9FKR","parent":"","index":"ZxS","collapsed":false,"note":"We're only using a code bullet here to show how cool it is 😬","type":"code","fields":{"text":"const nextSteps = \"Read the FAQ and Documentation below 👇\";\n\nconsole.log(nextSteps);","filename":"whatNow.js","lang":"javascript","lineNumbers":true}},{"id":"01M3E0KTSVF96VS9F466Z0ESXG","parent":"","index":"ZxQ","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"**Want to be part of the community?** Access our [forum](https://google.com) on GitHub"}},{"id":"01M3E22315R5PJ9BKA57PW7CWC","parent":"","index":"ZxFV","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"A lot of color themes and customizations"}},{"id":"01M3CPB8BN23FTEVB091S0SMBN","parent":"","index":"Zx8","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"Want to be convinced to use it in a few words? Here they are:"}},{"id":"01M3CPJDSFCBB4MA3QVVDT8323","parent":"","index":"ZxEV","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Benchmarked with up to *100k BULLETS*"}},{"id":"01M3HVS46CSA83JEM7GF3P8V69","parent":"","index":"ZxU","collapsed":false,"type":"title","fields":{"text":"FAQ","level":1}},{"id":"01M3HVS7ZDC0NXJXKVKN61SKVZ","parent":"","index":"ZxUV","collapsed":true,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"How much does TreeWrite cost?"}},{"id":"01M3HVYZZQ26X7HAH17EB7NYMV","parent":"","index":"ZxUl","collapsed":true,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Why use a custom file format instead of Markdown?"}},{"id":"01M3HWXHGGDD8VFSECY39MTH6F","parent":"","index":"ZxUt","collapsed":true,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Is there a risk that TreeWrite will cease to exist and I will lose my data?"}},{"id":"01M3HWXTA7Q8X8PKVHB7YPY7GG","parent":"01M3HVS7ZDC0NXJXKVKN61SKVZ","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3HWXWXMB60ZVMY5ADHQM5X4","parent":"01M3HVYZZQ26X7HAH17EB7NYMV","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3HWXZXWTJQ4PZG7R07V7E2F","parent":"01M3HWXHGGDD8VFSECY39MTH6F","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3HX3V6MEK90CX7ANF1W2FW5","parent":"","index":"ZxUx","collapsed":true,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Does TreeWrite have a mobile app?"}},{"id":"01M3HX5XVKFX19KJTECJBSBBVP","parent":"01M3HX3V6MEK90CX7ANF1W2FW5","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3J4PRT3YW6DZAD4H7DMCFVQ","parent":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","index":"Zz","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":"Bullets (also called outlines) are the basic building blocks of your notes"}},{"id":"01M3J4Z0ZT8Y7248FSMCQRP9B0","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a0","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Text","icon":"align-left.png"}},{"id":"01M3J4Z9GV8TWVPHVTPZY1CAES","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a0S","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Checkbox","icon":"square-check.png"}},{"id":"01M3J4ZDZXN8GVN8V94078BYA4","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a2","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Math","icon":"math-function.png"}},{"id":"01M3J4ZYC2DC92VSDF8JGHFR2Q","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a1l","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"File","icon":"file.png"}},{"id":"01M3J50TXFFWGNGN8NNFTYBVHQ","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a1V","collapsed":false,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Image","icon":"photo.png"}},{"id":"01M3J50WRNV5WD3QZXS4WY8Z1M","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a1t","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Code","icon":"code.png"}},{"id":"01M3J51292TQJCFQBNNBYSZ22T","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a6","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Page","icon":"app-window.png"}},{"id":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a1","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Callout","icon":"info-square-rounded.png"}},{"id":"01M3J51FAKEGFTNYG5C4HED541","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a0O","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Number","icon":"list-numbers.png"}},{"id":"01M3J51NV19VJDKJS5ENE5J6HE","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a0G","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Title","icon":"heading.png"}},{"id":"01M3J51THZ17VYMQE91XFV6E1N","parent":"01M3DG9Z1NNFGR3K5HWFDC01GM","index":"a0V","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Divider","icon":"separator.png"}},{"id":"01M3J5WW3S4MWAPSFN292W7MFJ","parent":"","index":"ZxUz","collapsed":true,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Does TreeWrite have folders?"}},{"id":"01M3J5WXXG3VFRT1VB79SVW6H7","parent":"01M3J5WW3S4MWAPSFN292W7MFJ","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3J5Z0W8RA8C0NZFTD0BEGMD","parent":"01M3J51NV19VJDKJS5ENE5J6HE","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"title","fields":{"text":"Heading 1","level":1}},{"id":"01M3J5Z997PD46J6XM3E16MVBH","parent":"01M3J51NV19VJDKJS5ENE5J6HE","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"title","fields":{"text":"Heading 2","level":2}},{"id":"01M3J5ZBF1ZQS4NQS9B57XDMCT","parent":"01M3J51NV19VJDKJS5ENE5J6HE","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"note":"Examples of title (h1, h2, h3)","type":"title","fields":{"text":"Heading 3","level":3}},{"id":"01M3J5ZXFZY7Z50BC5X8HZYB1W","parent":"01M3J51FAKEGFTNYG5C4HED541","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Item A"}},{"id":"01M3J606E77TX6CAEC8VKSE1AZ","parent":"01M3J51FAKEGFTNYG5C4HED541","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"number","fields":{"text":"Item B"}},{"id":"01M3J608NX4JMJ4ZJKJHV6FR1T","parent":"01M3J51FAKEGFTNYG5C4HED541","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"note":"Example of a numbered list","type":"number","fields":{"text":"Item C"}},{"id":"01M3J6PDE76HMXJ60SM5VJE7PS","parent":"01M3J4ZDZXN8GVN8V94078BYA4","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"note":"Example of the Normal/Gaussian distribution","type":"math","fields":{"text":"f(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}} e^{-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right)^2}"}},{"id":"01M3J7XC4FRHS0YARXND45F1JN","parent":"01M3J4ZDZXN8GVN8V94078BYA4","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"note":"Example of multiplying two 2 × 2 matrices","type":"math","fields":{"text":"\\begin{pmatrix}\na & b \\\\\nc & d\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nx & y \\\\\nz & w\n\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nax + bz & ay + bw \\\\\ncx + dz & cy + dw\n\\end{pmatrix}"}},{"id":"01M3J7XTGY3TT4XS5XD3T1B1B3","parent":"01M3J4ZDZXN8GVN8V94078BYA4","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"note":"Example of demonstrating the equivalence of Euler's Identity using Taylor Series. We can use multi-line LaTeX expressions","type":"math","fields":{"text":"\\begin{align*}\ne^{ix} &= 1 + ix + \\frac{(ix)^2}{2!} + \\frac{(ix)^3}{3!} + \\frac{(ix)^4}{4!} + \\dots \\\\\n&= 1 + ix - \\frac{x^2}{2!} - i\\frac{x^3}{3!} + \\frac{x^4}{4!} + \\dots \\\\\n&= \\left( 1 - \\frac{x^2}{2!} + \\frac{x^4}{4!} - \\dots \\right) + i\\left( x - \\frac{x^3}{3!} + \\frac{x^5}{5!} - \\dots \\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos(x) + i\\sin(x)\n\\end{align*}"}},{"id":"01M3PF0H7MXHY4C31FCQ2DKDYK","parent":"01M3J4Z9GV8TWVPHVTPZY1CAES","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"checkbox","fields":{"text":"Task A","checked":false}},{"id":"01M3PF0NC7QATMQ15BHR9HB0Y1","parent":"01M3J4Z0ZT8Y7248FSMCQRP9B0","index":"a0","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"Hello world, this is **bold**, *italic*, ***bold+italic*** and a [link](https://example.com)"},"note":"Example of a text bullet, with bold, italic, and link markers. Other text bullets may also support these markers"},{"id":"01M3PFWS97X0AV3QEFTRY5Q8EN","parent":"01M3J4Z9GV8TWVPHVTPZY1CAES","index":"a1","type":"checkbox","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"Task B","checked":true}},{"id":"01M3PFWTF3470P9AQ9B440BJW9","parent":"01M3J4Z9GV8TWVPHVTPZY1CAES","index":"a2","type":"checkbox","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"Task C","checked":false},"note":"Example of a checkbox list"},{"id":"01M3PFXC0PPXHMW816G8CJKDVS","parent":"01M3J51THZ17VYMQE91XFV6E1N","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"divider","fields":{}},{"id":"01M3PFXJ60GR5PP1QZNBB8Y58M","parent":"01M3J51THZ17VYMQE91XFV6E1N","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"divider","fields":{"text":"Hello, ***world***"},"note":"Examples of dividers with and without text"},{"id":"01M3PFYQNA16K3WA17X27TMVZ9","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","level":"neutral"},"note":"Callout without title"},{"id":"01M3PFZR8ABC34PDDD5E6YB041","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Neutral","level":"neutral"}},{"id":"01M3PG07WVRTQNC04ES4P27FED","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Success","level":"success"}},{"id":"01M3PG11WRJFBNS0QR2SPES5DT","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a3","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Info","level":"info"}},{"id":"01M3PG1JP9CQ1YQZMC9993NTRZ","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a4","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Danger","level":"danger"}},{"id":"01M3PG2NB7NEE3SYCBEPQ9NGQ7","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a5","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Warning","level":"warning"}},{"id":"01M3PG32TPBCZQQFCE41WF2N8X","parent":"01M3J516TYWQMNZTFY10E8GGF6","index":"a6","collapsed":false,"type":"callout","fields":{"text":"Hello world","title":"Important","level":"important"}},{"id":"01M3PG3TZ94G9653GPNKDQ2WHH","parent":"01M3J50TXFFWGNGN8NNFTYBVHQ","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"image","fields":{"src":"home-logo.svg","width":84},"note":"Example image. Images can be resized and are stored in the assets"},{"id":"01M3PG6AYA3H0NBYJHXE9STGFT","parent":"01M3J4ZYC2DC92VSDF8JGHFR2Q","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"file","fields":{"name":"home-logo.svg"},"note":"Example file. Clicking it opens the file on your system. Files are stored in the assets"},{"id":"01M3PG90DTRXS1MZ3EG6RSVWM8","parent":"01M3J50WRNV5WD3QZXS4WY8Z1M","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"code","fields":{"text":"console.log(\"Hello world\");","lang":"javascript"},"note":"Example of a code block"},{"id":"01M3PGAA4CGJWG307EF78HWCXX","parent":"01M3J50WRNV5WD3QZXS4WY8Z1M","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"code","fields":{"text":"const msg = \"Hello world\";\nconsole.log(msg);","filename":"helloWorld.js","lang":"javascript","lineNumbers":true},"note":"The code block can also have a filename and line numbers"},{"id":"01M3PGBXV651RJC6CT254WNVJR","parent":"01M3J50WRNV5WD3QZXS4WY8Z1M","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"type":"code","fields":{"text":"const msg = \"Hello world\";\nconsole.log(msg);","lang":"javascript","lineNumbers":true,"firstLineNumber":123},"note":"You can specify the first number of the line numbers"},{"id":"01M3PGHQZ1BXTBMCFN1Y2FJ2BM","parent":"01M3J51292TQJCFQBNNBYSZ22T","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"Hello ***world***","icon":"home-logo.svg","background":"northeast-road.jpeg","position":61},"note":"A page is like a text bullet, except you can add an icon and a background that will be displayed when you zoom in on the bullet. It's a way to organize your bullets into categories. If you are not zoomed in, the icon will appear as a miniature next to the text"},{"id":"01M3PGYRVFF2YTXBXFAF2AF2B2","parent":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","index":"ZzV","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"They are the main information stored in your `.jsonl` files. Each bullet has its own type and fields that define certain characteristics of the type"}},{"id":"01M3PH1SP8FRC7BXA1T00ZVED4","parent":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","index":"Zzl","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"For example, a callout bullet has a *level* field that can be success, info, ..."}},{"id":"01M3PH4H8NMM1761WFVXS1BCSW","parent":"01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","index":"Zzt","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"This type of representation allows bullets to have rich and customized formatting"}},{"id":"01M3PHNFAP5XG3TJ55Y7K7QYFP","parent":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","index":"a1","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"Basically, your bullets are stored in `.jsonl` ([JSON Lines](https://jsonlines.org)) files. This means that each line of the file is a JSON object containing either a single bullet information or metadata from your notes"}},{"id":"01M3PJ0N5HXB2JDXZ1VW4QPC2K","parent":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","index":"a2","collapsed":false,"type":"code","fields":{"text":"{\"id\": \"...\", \"type\": \"text\",  ...} // Bullet 1\n{\"id\": \"...\", \"type\": \"code\",  ...} // Bullet 2\n{\"id\": \"...\", \"type\": \"image\", ...} // Bullet 3\n{\"type\": \"metadata\", ...}           // Metadata","filename":"myBullets.jsonl","lang":"json","lineNumbers":true},"note":"Simplified example of what a `.jsonl` file looks like in TreeWrite"},{"id":"01M3PJCQZ75TFMC90YZQXP7N4S","parent":"01M3CK4D608BX01BDWAWPSDR8G","index":"a3","collapsed":true,"type":"page","fields":{"text":"**File format specification**","icon":"📄"}},{"id":"01M3PKTR18HFRBASFTM9NSQAT1","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a0","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"The `.jsonl` file follows an [append-only log](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Append-only) structure. This means that adding, removing, and updating bullets or metadata never alters already written JSON objects"}},{"id":"01M3PMQ77HSFHC76DV2SN4YXDC","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"code","fields":{"text":"{\"id\": \"123\", \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Hello\", ...}       // First edit\n{\"id\": \"123\", \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Hello world\", ...} // Second edit","filename":"myBullets.jsonl","lang":"json","lineNumbers":true},"note":"Demonstration of how the append-only log works. We write the text \"Hello\" in a bullet, and then update it to \"Hello world\". Instead of updating the existing row, we append a new duplicate row with the updated fields. From now on, only the last line is counted by TreeWrite, and the previous ones are ignored"},{"id":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","parent":"01M3CK4D608BX01BDWAWPSDR8G","index":"Zz","type":"text","collapsed":true,"fields":{"text":"Basic concepts of `.jsonl` files"}},{"id":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","parent":"01M3CK4D608BX01BDWAWPSDR8G","index":"a0","type":"text","collapsed":true,"fields":{"text":"Append-only log structure"}},{"id":"01M3PN5ER03X0D2RKAE66C5533","parent":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","index":"a3","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"All bullets have base fields (like `id` and `type`) and extra fields specific to each bullet type"}},{"id":"01M3PNZSWS8DX0ZM55JRMND93G","parent":"01M3PN11TSYJJH8TYNFZ3SNCZ7","index":"a4","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"Metadata is an object that contains information such as settings (favorites, tags, ...)"}},{"id":"01M3PP2TFSZEZ27PDMY86VGV3J","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a2","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"The reason behind this decision is very simple: ***performance***"}},{"id":"01M3PPGNXFJJ74A3GPMQDYBTXY","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a3","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"If we were to update the bullet line with the new values, we would have to rewrite the entire file with each edit. This is because the lines don't have a fixed byte length, and we can't update a JSON object in the middle of the file without updating everything else. But appending new data to a file in the file system is a cheap and fast operation"}},{"id":"01M3PPGQJ8G51V2H9XGMJG5EVX","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a4","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"You might be thinking that this approach would eventually leave the file huge and with a lot of old data from the same bullet, and that's true"}},{"id":"01M3PPK1E7FF4Y8QJGMDB7VKDV","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a5","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"The condition that is verified is:"}},{"id":"01M3PPVZSG47D30XEWF3E4GE9Q","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a7","collapsed":false,"type":"math","fields":{"text":"\\begin{aligned}\n&L > 2B + S \\\\[6pt]\n&\\text{where:} \\\\\n&\\quad L = \\text{number of non-empty lines in the file} \\\\\n&\\quad B = \\text{number of bullets currently in the document} \\\\\n&\\quad S = 1000 \\;\\text{(fixed slack)}\n\\end{aligned}"}},{"id":"01M3PQB6HBZW7NQ32X3K9DTATE","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a8","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"In summary, the append-only log structure allows updates to your bullets to be made almost instantly, regardless of the number of bullets in your document"}},{"id":"01M3PQGKNZ1KXP8CY1W76W8HYH","parent":"01M3PN21SX7VYQZTVH1TSFBE25","index":"a4V","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":"To resolve this, each edit validates whether the file is growing too large and should be cleaned up to contain only the most recent data. If that's the case, then the file is rewritten, now containing only the latest data"}},{"id":"01M3PQKVCDGZ6BJDFKCMSJKTG6","parent":"01M3PJCQZ75TFMC90YZQXP7N4S","index":"a0","type":"text","collapsed":false,"fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3PQMYTYS7T9B3M87JK2G2PJ","parent":"","index":"ZxUp","type":"number","collapsed":true,"fields":{"text":"Why use a custom file format instead of a database (like SQLite)?"}},{"id":"01M3PQNDJNDAR7PA57KP1E08JC","parent":"01M3PQMYTYS7T9B3M87JK2G2PJ","index":"a0","collapsed":false,"type":"text","fields":{"text":""}},{"id":"01M3PQVVKYCGVC293RRR3Q725W","parent":"01M3J50TXFFWGNGN8NNFTYBVHQ","index":"a1","collapsed":false,"type":"image","fields":{"src":"northeast-road.jpeg","width":201}}],"metadata":{"settings":{"theme":{"hue":0,"saturation":0,"primary":"#f21616","secondary":"#ffa903","tertiary":"#605cac","colorScheme":"dark","codeSyntax":"github"},"home":{"icon":"home-logo.svg","title":"TreeWrite","background":"home-background.svg"},"features":{}},"tags":[{"id":"01M3HD4Q8SDKV6D551TEB1957Q","name":"Hello world","color":"#4c6ef5"},{"id":"01M3HD4Z3S8XWR28Y0KX66CH5Y","name":"Foo bar","color":"#40c057"}],"favorites":["01M3CNK6ZRBGVM62Z4J03JPDZ7","01M3CK4D608BX01BDWAWPSDR8G","01M3CJQZTGBY1KNX195FMMDHA5","01M3CKKTSAKT9DVE52BA7VV5K0","01M3CKKYE39X7JV1VXT1H4WBCJ","01M3CK4TT3EEMYQ55VSYQVCFZK","01M3CK4AA3MES7HVDZBMNQYHER","01M3CNZ3ZP6FB4C9V4SABK4N7M"]},"assets":[{"name":"align-left.png","size":2889},{"name":"app-window.png","size":4389},{"name":"code.png","size":4353},{"name":"file.png","size":4206},{"name":"heading.png","size":2927},{"name":"home-background.svg","size":22641},{"name":"home-logo.svg","size":21796},{"name":"info-square-rounded.png","size":10050},{"name":"list-numbers.png","size":5315},{"name":"math-function.png","size":7596},{"name":"northeast-road.jpeg","size":153879},{"name":"photo.png","size":6421},{"name":"separator.png","size":2412},{"name":"square-check.png","size":4783}]}